        }
      }
    },
    "Verbinal provides a native interface for managing interactive computing sessions on the CANFAR platform." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verbinal offre une interface native pour gérer les sessions de calcul interactif sur la plate-forme CANFAR."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verbinal stays private until you opt in. Turning this on starts a local helper that Claude connects to — nothing is exposed to the network." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verbinal reste privé tant que vous n'y consentez pas. L'activation démarre un assistant local auquel Claude se connecte — rien n'est exposé au réseau."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verbinal stays private until you opt in. Turning this on starts a local MCP server that Claude connects to — nothing is exposed to the network." : {
